     "*   *Sphere Intersection (Alternative):* If the volume is spherical, calculate `oc = ro - cloudCenter`, `b = dot(oc, rd)`, `c = dot(oc, oc) - cloudRadius * cloudRadius`, `disc = b*b - c`.",
